&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#75715e">-- Load acts and regulation file data
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#75715e">&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">CREATE&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">TABLE&lt;/span> scraped_data &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">AS&lt;/span> (
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">WITH&lt;/span> combined_sources &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">AS&lt;/span> (
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT&lt;/span> url, text, &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">unnest&lt;/span>(split(file_name, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#39;,&amp;#39;&lt;/span>)) &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">AS&lt;/span> unnested_file_name
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">FROM&lt;/span> read_csv(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#39;acts_07_02_2025.csv&amp;#39;&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">WHERE&lt;/span> file_name &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">IS&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">NOT&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">NULL&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">UNION&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">ALL&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT&lt;/span> url, text, &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">unnest&lt;/span>(split(file_name, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#39;,&amp;#39;&lt;/span>)) &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">AS&lt;/span> unnested_file_name
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">FROM&lt;/span> read_csv(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#39;regulations_07_02_2025.csv&amp;#39;&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">WHERE&lt;/span> file_name &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">IS&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">NOT&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">NULL&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> )
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT&lt;/span> url, text, unnested_file_name[&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">10&lt;/span>:] &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">AS&lt;/span> file_name
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">FROM&lt;/span> combined_sources
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>);
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">CREATE&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">TABLE&lt;/span> valid_files &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">AS&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">*&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">FROM&lt;/span> scraped_data &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">WHERE&lt;/span> (&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">contains&lt;/span>(url, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#39;/acts/&amp;#39;&lt;/span>) &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">OR&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">contains&lt;/span>(url, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#39;/regs/&amp;#39;&lt;/span>)) &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">AND&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">NOT&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">contains&lt;/span>(file_name, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#39;/legislation/&amp;#39;&lt;/span>);
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#75715e">-- COPY valid_files TO &amp;#39;valid_links_07_02_2025.csv&amp;#39; WITH CSV HEADER;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>This creates a consolidated table from both acts and regulations files, then filters for valid URLs containing &amp;lsquo;/acts/&amp;rsquo; or &amp;lsquo;/regs/&amp;rsquo; but not &amp;lsquo;/legislation/&amp;rsquo;.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Project Structure</title><link>http://localhost:1313/notes/konze-legal-ai/project-structure/</link><pubDate>Fri, 04 Apr 2025 11:24:28 +0530</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/notes/konze-legal-ai/project-structure/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group">Project Structure Overview
